<title>USA: Fluor Corp Q4 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Fluor Corp Q4 earnings summary.</headline>
<text>
<p>IRVINE, Calif., Nov 20 (Reuter)</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.93		    $0.79</p>
<p> Net		 78,900		   66,000</p>
<p> Revs		3,327,700		2,575,600</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  84,600		   84,000</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $3.17		    $2.78</p>
<p> Net		 268,100		  231,800</p>
<p> Revs		11,015,200	     9,301,400</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  84,600		   83,400</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Period ended October 31.</p>
